---
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Privacy Policy - Vix Movies</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Vix Movies Privacy Policy outlines our data handling practices, cookie policies, and commitment to user safety." />
    <style>
      body {
        background-color: #0b0f19;
        color: #f8fafc;
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0 15px 40px 15px;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 900px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }
      .page-card {
        background: #1e293b;
        border: 1px solid #334155;
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 24px;
        margin-top: 20px;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }
      h1 {
        color: #38bdf8;
        font-size: 24px;
        margin-top: 0;
      }
      h2 {
        color: #f8fafc;
        font-size: 16px;
        margin-top: 20px;
      }
      p, li {
        color: #cbd5e1;
        font-size: 13px;
      }
      ul {
        padding-left: 20px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <Navbar />

      <main class="page-card">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p>Effective Date: January 1, 2026</p>

        <p>At <strong>Vix Movies</strong>, accessible from our web address, one of our main priorities is the privacy of our visitors. This Privacy Policy document outlines the types of information collected and recorded by Vix Movies and how we use it.</p>

        <h2>1. Log Files</h2>
        <p>Vix Movies follows a standard procedure of using log files. These files log visitors when they visit websites. The information collected includes internet protocol (IP) addresses, browser type, Internet Service Provider (ISP), date and time stamp, referring/exit pages, and possibly the number of clicks.</p>

        <h2>2. Cookies and Web Beacons</h2>
        <p>Like any other website, Vix Movies uses 'cookies'. These cookies are used to store information including visitors' preferences, and the pages on the website that the visitor accessed or visited. The information is used to optimize the users' experience by customizing our web page content based on visitors' browser type and/or other information.</p>

        <h2>3. Google DoubleClick DART Cookie</h2>
        <p>Google is one of a third-party vendor on our site. It also uses cookies, known as DART cookies, to serve ads to our site visitors based upon their visit to our site and other sites on the internet.</p>

        <h2>4. Third-Party Links & Content</h2>
        <p>Vix Movies does not host copyrighted media files directly on its servers. All media items are fetched via standard public APIs (such as The Movie Database - TMDB). Third-party ad servers or ad networks use technology in their respective advertisements and links.</p>

        <h2>5. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have additional questions or require more information about our Privacy Policy, do not hesitate to contact us via email at <a href="mailto:brazilmarketing1@gmail.com" style="color: #38bdf8;">brazilmarketing1@gmail.com</a>.</p>
      </main>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
